    "offering_evidence": [
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-010341",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-010341-be72e6ab741bc1ea",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-010341",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Boston Omaha Corporation, which we refer to as “the Company,” “our Company,” “we,” “us” or “our,” commenced its current business operations in June 2015 and currently operates four separate lines of business: outdoor billboard advertising, broadband services, surety insurance and related brokerage activities, and an asset management business.",
        "start_character": 30,
        "end_character": 374
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-010341",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-010341-be72e6ab741bc1ea",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-010341",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In 2016, we were listed for trading on the OTCQX under the trading symbol “BOMN,” and in June 2017, in connection with our 2017 public offering, we transferred and uplisted to the NASDAQ Capital Market under the trading symbol “BOMN.” On January 14, 2022, we transferred our listing to the New York Stock Exchange and now trade under the trading symbol “BOC.”",
        "start_character": 15916,
        "end_character": 16275
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-010341",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-010341-be72e6ab741bc1ea",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-010341",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In August 2021, Yellowstone entered into a business combination agreement with Sky Harbour LLC, which we refer to as \"SHG,\" a developer of private aviation infrastructure focused on building, leasing and managing business aviation hangars.",
        "start_character": 11638,
        "end_character": 11877
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-010341",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-010341-be72e6ab741bc1ea",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-010341",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In September 2021, we announced the launch of Fiber Fast Homes, LLC, which we refer to as \"FFH,\" which partners with builders, developers and build for rent communities to build fiber-to-the-home infrastructure and provide fiber internet service to residents.",
        "start_character": 4990,
        "end_character": 5249
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-010341",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-010341-be72e6ab741bc1ea",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-010341",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, through our FFH business, we have entered into contracts with home builders to bring fiber-to-the-home in large residential developments currently under construction and expect to continue to expand this to additional developments in the future.",
        "start_character": 49147,
        "end_character": 49405
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-010341",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-010341-be72e6ab741bc1ea",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-010341",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we hold minority investments in commercial real estate management and brokerage services, a bank focused on servicing the automotive loan market, a company serving the broadband industry, and a publicly-traded developer of private aviation infrastructure focused on building, leasing and managing business aviation hangars.",
        "start_character": 375,
        "end_character": 711
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-010341",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-010341-be72e6ab741bc1ea",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-010341",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we may have sellers roll over a portion of their equity holdings into an equity holding in the newly acquired business.",
        "start_character": 84126,
        "end_character": 84258
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-010341",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-010341-be72e6ab741bc1ea",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-010341",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In private communities and mobile home parks, we may be required to obtain the consent of the homeowners association or other property owners to provide services, and we often have to pay a fee to obtain access to the property and provide our services.",
        "start_character": 68695,
        "end_character": 68947
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-010341",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-010341-be72e6ab741bc1ea",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-010341",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Since September 2015, we have made a series of investments in commercial real estate, a commercial real estate management, brokerage and related services business as well as an asset management business.",
        "start_character": 8129,
        "end_character": 8332
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-010341",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-010341-be72e6ab741bc1ea",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-010341",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also compete with other businesses that do not fall into the categories above that provide risk-related services and products.",
        "start_character": 51419,
        "end_character": 51548
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-010341",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-010341-be72e6ab741bc1ea",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-010341",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We currently operate outdoor billboard advertising services, provide broadband services, and sell surety insurance products and have minority investments in commercial real estate management and brokerage companies, a bank focused on servicing the automotive loan market, and a developer of private aviation infrastructure focused on building, leasing and managing business aviation hangars.",
        "start_character": 32983,
        "end_character": 33374
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-010341",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-010341-be72e6ab741bc1ea",
